<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alternative Resources cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alternative Resources cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it lowered its intermediate rating on Alternative Resource Corp to market performer from outperform, based on the stock's valuation.</p>
<p>- It said its earnings estimates remain unchanged at $0.86 per share in 1996 and $1.12 for 1997.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
